=== DIAGNOSIS ===
is_anomaly: false
faulty_devices: none
diagnosis_text:
The reported fault — "sshswitch SVIs for VLAN 5 and VLAN 6 are down" — does not exist in the live lab. Direct inspection of sshswitch reveals that both Layer-3 bridge interfaces are fully operational: `br_v5` is UP with address 10.5.0.254/24 and `br_v6` is UP with address 10.6.0.254/24. All subordinate VLAN subinterfaces (eth0.5, eth0.6, bond0.5, bond0.6) are in the spanning-tree forwarding state with LOWER_UP physical carrier. A live ping from pc1 (VLAN 5 host, 10.5.0.1) to its default gateway 10.5.0.254 returns 0% loss with sub-millisecond RTTs; the same holds for pc3 (VLAN 6, 10.6.0.3) to 10.6.0.254. OSPF on sshswitch is in Full adjacency state with router17, and the routing table correctly carries all campus prefixes. A comprehensive 28-pair reachability probe across every end-host pair in the topology (spanning VLANs 5, 6, 10, 20, 30) shows zero packet loss on every test. The network is healthy in all observable respects. The helpdesk ticket is based on a false premise; no corrective action is needed. The reporter may have observed a transient issue during lab start-up convergence (OSPF takes ~30–60 s to reach Full state), but at steady state the gateway SVIs are functioning correctly.
=== END ===